3181 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Noise\072 maps as pure functions of position\n\nRandom access\056 You can ask for the height at any point without computing anything else\056 This is what makes infinite worlds possible\072 No Man\047s Sky does not store a galaxy\054 it evaluates one\056\n\nTrivially parallel\056 Every pixel is independent\054 so it maps perfectly onto GPU threads\054 worker threads\054 or a vectorised NumPy call\056\n\nDeterministic and reproducible\056 Same seed\054 same coordinates\054 same result \024 forever\054 on any machine\054 in any order\056 Seeds become the save file\056\n\nChunkable\056 Neighbouring chunks agree automatically at their shared border\054 because both are evaluating the same underlying function\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 3182 0 R
     /Pg 1276 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

