  << /ActualText (Shaping the output\n\nThe same noise stack produces wildly different maps depending on what you do with the value afterwards\056 These are essentially free\054 and they are where most of the visual character comes from\056\n\nConsider this math modifiers for the noise values\072\n\055Ridged\n\055Billow\n\055Turbulence\n\055Terracing\n\055Power curve\n\055Domain warping)
